y: what do other people mean when they say crossover?<br /> <br /> My assumption is that crossover means having PC's as different splats. If we mean that vampires and demons and beasts and mages still exist in the same world as the central splat, that's kind of my default.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T15:29:40-08:00","id":832122,"title":"","content":"well, between the Snow Queen inspiration for the Durance, an unhealthy (partly scientific, partly romantic) obsession with his Fetch and all the Jinn atmosphere, I think have a character concept! Just need to decide if he's expat or citizen. How difficult it would be for two people to have the same identity/ create a fake identity in Dubai?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T15:30:43-08:00","id":832124,"title":"","content":"Pretty tough, I imagine.<br /> <br /> Waiting for more information before I declare myself a runaway princess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T15:51:30-08:00","id":832143,"title":"","content":"I think that homosexual sex (and PDA in general) being a very hush-hush thing fits thematically with the overall mood of secrecy and paranoia in Lost society. Also resonates a bit with the &quot;fundamentally different from the rest&quot; angle.<br /> <br /> Right now I am tentatively considering something like Nightsinger, Minstrel or Muse. Maybe Trusser? Generally aiming for a Fairest Seeming with some hidden self-loathing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:02:51-08:00","id":832148,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832120#post832120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, question for clarity: what do other people mean when they say crossover?<br /> <br /> My assumption is that crossover means having PC's as different splats. If we mean that vampires and demons and beasts and mages still exist in the same world as the central splat, that's kind of my default.</div> </div> </div> </div>My assumption is the same, but I call it crossover so people are forewarned. Since this about playtesting changeling, I'm assuming everyone will be changelings or Fae-Touched. Maybe with time other splats wander in as players.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832122#post832122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">well, between the Snow Queen inspiration for the Durance, an unhealthy (partly scientific, partly romantic) obsession with his Fetch and all the Jinn atmosphere, I think have a character concept! Just need to decide if he's expat or citizen. How difficult it would be for two people to have the same identity/ create a fake identity in Dubai?</div> </div> </div> </div>Really tough... unless you have the right connections. That's not to say I myself ever had or ever will, but you can do pretty much anything if you know the right person. I imagine that a big role of the Courts would be to help create new identities for those who cannot reclaim theirs.<br /> <br /> Okay, starting to get some more concrete ideas with some time to think. Will up date soon. Here's some other idiosyncrasies that may help plan characters and courts.<br /> - Religion is totally free as long as you don't try and convert anyone (most especially Muslims). Proselytization is totally illegal, but there are Sunnis and Shia of all stripes, tons of churches, three Hindu temples, and at least one Sikh temple.<br /> - The holy day is Friday, so weekends are Friday-Saturday. Friday morning is usually the best time to go shopping since most people are at mosque.<br /> - Anywhere selling alcohol has to be attached to a hotel, so most clubs are literally underground or overlooking the ocean from some ritzy building.<br /> - Friday brunches are a thing. Brunch actually means get dressed up, eat expensive food, and get wasted at one of said hotels.<br /> - If you aren't Muslim, you don't have to pretend or act like you are. Groceries stores will usually have a dedicated pork section that is separated from the rest of the store and hidden in some obscure corner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:06:32-08:00","id":832152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowKnight1224</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832143#post832143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that homosexual sex (and PDA in general) being a very hush-hush thing fits thematically with the overall mood of secrecy and paranoia in Lost society. Also resonates a bit with the &quot;fundamentally different from the rest&quot; angle.<br /> <br /> Right now I am tentatively considering something like Nightsinger, Minstrel or Muse. Maybe Trusser? Generally aiming for a Fairest Seeming with some hidden self-loathing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, given that all of us have expressed an interest in LBGT characters and that the central story literally has to do with the genesis of the devil, secrecy and paranoia are the least of the interesting connections going on here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:17:33-08:00","id":832158,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832037#post832037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok- let's think a bit.<br /> <br /> the story told by the Freehold is the Fall of Iblis. As such, they see their Escape as being &quot;Banished&quot; from Jannah for not fulfilling their role in the story. The current Iblis and the Emir of the Freehold is the last changeling to be banished (that is, the last to return from the Hedge). It also means the current ruler is the least experienced one, and because of all the expats the Freehold must make sure no one shows up which breaks that Bulwark. The new Iblis must defy the older one and demand the throne for himself. The protection of the Freehold is always said to not be eternal, but only until &quot;Judgement Day&quot; would come. The definition for what a &quot;Judgement Day&quot; is could be either open ended or strictly detailed, with around 1000 different terms and conditions.<br /> <br /> thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>I really like this idea. What cool is that it also mirrors Dubai's history; the royal family was originally cousins of Abu Dhabi's royal family that broke away for form their own community. The act of banishment mirrors the story of Iblis' fall, but the return from the Empty Quarter to take the role of Emir mirrors the founding of Dubai itself. More thoughts coming, I think I've got a bead on the Bulwark.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:30:19-08:00","id":832164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832003#post832003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe it could be a &quot;scapegoat&quot; style Bulwark? That is, one of the Changelings in the Court must defy the current Monarch (Emir) and be banished away, which should put it in danger to the attacks of an Huntsmen. In that case, either she needs to survive in the role of Shaitan a certain amount of time or- if we want something a bit darker- get killed, and the Bulwark is broken if she survives and returns to Court. Considering the &quot;either filthy rich or lowly poor&quot; atmosphere, those who take the role of Iblis are usually from society's rock bottom.<br /> <br /> Too dark, perhaps?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd almost tweek it like this: The Shaitan gets dumped in the Empty Quarter and has to make her/his way back and claim the Emir's role within an allotted time. The twist is that one must volunteer to be the Shaitan. The Bulwark fails if no one volunteers or if the Shaitan refuses to claim the Emir's role after defeating the Emir (whatever that looks like). And it is the Emir who gets the final say as to which volunteer becomes the next Shaitan. <br /> <br /> Thoughts? I see lots of potential for politicing in this situation, and I think I have a mythology that makes the choice of this type of Bulwark make sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:34:24-08:00","id":832167,"title":"","content":"*is waiting anxiously*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:45:06-08:00","id":832179,"title":"","content":"Since Bulwark is wrapping up and Courts are coming on, a semi-related question: Where in the 2 to 5 range were you looking at that for courts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:45:37-08:00","id":832181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832021#post832021\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I plan on making a character with a very unhealthy and weird fascination with his Fetch. He doesn't want him killed- but to see how he'll act in different situations and see how different they are. He see him as his &quot;other me&quot;. And yeah, it also means his Clarity isn't too high.</div> </div> </div> </div>Notably, The Fetch is one of the sample Touchstone options.<br /> <br /> I think I'm actually going to have to drop out. I'm not going to have the time to dedicate to this that it deserves. Thank you though, and have fun!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:49:28-08:00","id":832183,"title":"","content":"&quot;The Europeans can make up whatever whimsical butterfly people they want to explain the Gentry. We know what took us. It was the Jinn.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;Changelings not from Dubai are always taken aback by the fact that our Bulwark is tied to The story of Iblis. Ha! As if anything could be more natural. The Jinn took us and infused the clay of our bodies with smokeless fire, making us like them. The Iblian Bulwark reminds us every day of where our people came from and what we must do to return to God's grace.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;When Iblis would not yield to humanity, he made a choice to be exiled. Now, one of us must too make that chock to keep the Jinn from coming to find us again. This isn't Iblis's story though and we can rewrite the ending. Should the exile return and master his exiler, he rebounds the Dubai stronghold just as the city was founded when the Al-Maktoum family broke away from the Banu Yas, with it comes the power, glory and wealth of being the ruler of all...after you have sent your own exile into the Empty Quarter. Power has a price after all. What are you willing to pay to have it?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:50:52-08:00","id":832185,"title":"","content":"I think three or four works. The idea of Angel, Jinn, Human could work, but so too could social status or professions like Oil, Tourism, Labour, and Education.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T16:54:26-08:00","id":832186,"title":"","content":"I dunno, I think we can do more to tie into the themes of hubris, arrogance, humility-the themes of the exile usurper and the holy order that must be kept. It is a diamond with many facets.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T17:54:05-08:00","id":832215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832152#post832152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, given that all of us have expressed an interest in LBGT characters and that the central story literally has to do with the genesis of the devil, secrecy and paranoia are the least of the interesting connections going on here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, sorry, I was just spitballing to try and get a feel for the character.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832186#post832186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dunno, I think we can do more to tie into the themes of hubris, arrogance, humility-the themes of the exile usurper and the holy order that must be kept. It is a diamond with many facets.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have some ideas:<br /> <br /> Court of [Ascendance?]: Believers in turning their Fae side for &quot;good&quot;, feed on arrogance, tend to be hubristic but powerful in matters of the Wyrd.<br /> Court of [Penance?]: Believers in atoning for their Faeness, which they see as a contamination, feed on humility, tend to be very good at mortal connections.<br /> Court of [Order?]: Keepers of rituals and oaths, feed on obedience, tend to be excellent pledgecrafters and archivists.<br /> Court of [Transition?]: Bringers of change, feed on uncertainty, make sure the Freehold is always staying one step ahead of the Gentry and the Huntsman, and that changelings keep up with the times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T18:45:37-08:00","id":832232,"title":"","content":"I'm musing on the subject of courts, and this line came to me that I wanna toss for people's consideration:<br /> <br /> &quot;That which overthrows God and makes new holiness&quot;<br /> <br /> An immediate thought was Homura in Rebellion, if you've seen it.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Also, &quot;Damning Virtue, rather than Vice&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 02-17-2016, 09:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:02:23-08:00","id":832239,"title":"","content":"I think that would be rather interesting to explore. It sounds like it encourages changelings to be constructive and creative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:09:24-08:00","id":832244,"title":"","content":"Well, I think what my mind was getting at is that the Bulwark demands that Shaytan be a damning, upsetting influence, that which disrupts providence....but it also demands that the Shaytan be a potential God unto themselves-if they usurp the Emir, they act as God, their disruption is now providence. Iblis's story also is primarily an exercise in virtuous acts for unholy intentions-he worships to become Lord over the Earth by the wish of Allah, and his sin, that he is cast down for, is not accepting Adam. The Courts are facets of the stories, both exhortions to return to their holy place in God's order, from jinn to human....and how such a quest can become lost as holiness can hide sinful attitude, even from the one who is acting in holiness.<br /> <br /> Now, granted, I have a thing for duality and things masking one another. Paris has a lot of things going on, but one is the interplay equal-but-kind-of-opposite values. So, you know, grain of salt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:24:43-08:00","id":832258,"title":"","content":"Eh, I need to go do something else now, cause thoughts. Still, here's what little I got as a brainstorm. These aren't suggestion, just brain poopings<br /> <br /> The Court of Clay(Humanity)-Powerless/slothful Humility, The Simple Statue(Promethean?)<br /> The Court of Stars(smokeless fire/minor Deceived tie in)-Envious Ambition(Infinitude of being?), The Burning Vision<br /> The Court of Song(Angels)-Blind Worship, The Unwavering Prayer?(Demon?)<br /> The Court of Tides(???/a new one representing foreigners, like a carthian movement? Pagans and rebels?)-Cheating Love/kindness?, The Open Cavern?(Beast?)<br /> <br /> Rise And Fall. The outsider coming in, Odyseuss perhaps. Mirrormask, for some reason, is slipping in.<br /> <br /> That which overthrows god and makes new holiness-Rebellion Homura<br /> <br /> Damning Virtue, not Vice<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:47:07-08:00","id":832277,"title":"","content":"Actually, You know what'd be cool?<br /> <br /> if the Iblis Character, upon being exiled, had some Wyrd binding that made it so he could having working relationships with Huntsmen and Loyalists for the purpose of usurping. On the one hand, the Huntsmen have an in, on the other hand, they have a leash. Something like that'd be interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T19:47:31-08:00","id":832278,"title":"","content":"Some ideas to build off that:<br /> <br /> Court of Clay: Powerless/Slothful seem like things that are not terribly interesting narrative-wise. How about Awe-struck Humility instead? It resonates with the luxury and beauty of Dubai itself, and may draw changelings that are both awe-inspiring and humble, each taking part in a different part of the Court's idea. Perhaps &quot;Court of Spires&quot; might be an interesting take instead?<br /> Court of Stars: I feel Burning Ambition might fit better?<br /> Court of Song: I think we can do something here with the idea that mankind's creations are ways to praise the divine. Songs, buildings that reach the sky, ceremonies. Maybe it's less Blind Worship and more like Thoughtful Worship? Which would make the emotion more rarefied and harder to find.<br /> Court of Tides: I think &quot;Indulgence&quot; might fit here. You escaped, found freedom, and now can indulge in it. Perhaps &quot;Secret Indulgence&quot; as a more specific form?<br /> <br /> And then you can basically tie all four Courts as different aspects of Dubai itself, with its awe-inspiring, ambitious towers that rise up to the sky as if seeking to touch divinity, where you can indulge in luxury or simply freedom.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T20:00:09-08:00","id":832284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832244#post832244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I think what my mind was getting at is that the Bulwark demands that Shaytan be a damning, upsetting influence, that which disrupts providence....but it also demands that the Shaytan be a potential God unto themselves-if they usurp the Emir, they act as God, their disruption is now providence. Iblis's story also is primarily an exercise in virtuous acts for unholy intentions-he worships to become Lord over the Earth by the wish of Allah, and his sin, that he is cast down for, is not accepting Adam. The Courts are facets of the stories, both exhortions to return to their holy place in God's order, from jinn to human....and how such a quest can become lost as holiness can hide sinful attitude, even from the one who is acting in holiness.<br /> <br /> Now, granted, I have a thing for duality and things masking one another. Paris has a lot of things going on, but one is the interplay equal-but-kind-of-opposite values. So, you know, grain of salt.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm starting to dig this more. It actually can describe aspects of the city quite well. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832258#post832258\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, I need to go do something else now, cause thoughts. Still, here's what little I got as a brainstorm. These aren't suggestion, just brain poopings<br /> <br /> The Court of Clay(Humanity)-Powerless/slothful Humility, The Simple Statue(Promethean?)<br /> The Court of Stars(smokeless fire/minor Deceived tie in)-Envious Ambition(Infinitude of being?), The Burning Vision<br /> The Court of Song(Angels)-Blind Worship, The Unwavering Prayer?(Demon?)<br /> The Court of Tides(???/a new one representing foreigners, like a carthian movement? Pagans and rebels?)-Cheating Love/kindness?, The Open Cavern?(Beast?)<br /> <br /> Rise And Fall. The outsider coming in, Odyseuss perhaps. Mirrormask, for some reason, is slipping in.<br /> <br /> That which overthrows god and makes new holiness-Rebellion Homura<br /> <br /> Damning Virtue, not Vice<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Those seem workable. The Court of Song could easily tie in with the Adhan, which is the call to prayer and is a daily song in everywhere. I don't really think of Clay and Tides in UAE though. Clay could work because of the Mangroves. Maybe Court of Dunes or Sand instead of Tides? Since sand gets in absolutely everything and you can't get it out? I feel like I'm being real blunt with my metaphors today, although that may be lack of sleep talking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T20:02:55-08:00","id":832285,"title":"","content":"I went with tides because it rounded out the alternative classical elements theme I sort of had going on, and because I imagine more foreign gods came from across the ocean than from the desert, though both are weak reasonings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T20:12:24-08:00","id":832290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832285#post832285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I went with tides because it rounded out the alternative classical elements theme I sort of had going on, and because I imagine more foreign gods came from across the ocean than from the desert, though both are weak reasonings.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just came up with another alternate then. Keep Stars and Song, use Sand in place of Clay, and use Pearls (which were the primary income before oil) instead of Tides. Although I do quite like the idea of a Court of Spires as the outsider faction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T22:39:53-08:00","id":832331,"title":"","content":"I still think that there should be Shaytan Court - newly chosen Iblis should try to tempt members of others Courts to join him, for the inner-Bulwark dynamics, like you have in procession of Seasons or Day and Night cycles.<br /> <br /> Shaytan Court makes politics and relations inner Freehold intense by their role.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T23:01:10-08:00","id":832339,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't make that a court. More like an extended temporary motley.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 02-18-2016, 02:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T23:29:46-08:00","id":832351,"title":"","content":"To truly have power base in Dubai Freehold after turning from their previous Courts, Shaytan would need:<br /> <br /> 1. <b>Resources</b> - Money, new identities, Tokens, many smaller and greater things to compel others to join them and forsake their previous Courts, at least for a year.<br /> 2. <b>Emotion</b> - Or just simple &quot;Vice&quot; as general Glamour Harvesting theme?<br /> 3. <b>Magic</b> - Some thematic Contract in filling their role as Adversaries.<br /> 4. <b>Structure</b> - Under this year Iblis. Who do what and how they are different in the levels from now Iblis.<br /> <br /> To me it sounds a lot more like Court than a Motley...<br /> <br /> Question is rather how transition would be made - <b>If you were member of normal Courts, gone to the Shaytan, would you lose your Mantel in original Court?</b> Would your Mantel in Shaytan be one dot lower? Could you return to your previous Court after end of this year Iblis and set again yourself in original position?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-17T23:49:11-08:00","id":832360,"title":"","content":"The politics of the city are a big reason why the Shaytan Court is <i>not</i> a great idea, not the least of which is your Mantle comment(Because yes, that would lead to a lot of Mantle loss, people switching from one to the other constantly).<br /> <br /> The simple fact of the matter is that a Court like that is that it relies too much on a foundation that shifts. The goals and motives of the Shaytan, beyond the basics, change with each exile, and that means people with interest in backing the Shaytan changes all the time. Because of that, you just can't have a stable organization.*<br /> <br /> Thematically, as well, there are two aspects to keep in mind. One is that it's more appropriate for Iblis to sway members from the other courts onto his side, to usurp and incite rebellion. The other factor to keep in mind is that in the story we're working off of, there was sin, but no whisperer-the jinn aren't inherently malicious, they just kind of end up that way for all the reasons humans with powers would. Having a pre-established hell faction kills some of the mood of both those factors.<br /> <br /> On top of that, it's overly simplistic and boring. I'm not designing this, but I still wouldn't want to advocate boring and simplistic.<br /> <br /> *Now, if we do want them to have a faction still, this is why I recommended of giving them a way to recruit Huntsmen and Loyalists-Arcadian forces inherently have more invested in the few constants of Iblis, and it plays into the struggle of changelings caught between their clay and smokeless fire identities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T04:45:51-08:00","id":832442,"title":"","content":"Having the current Shaytan as someone with ties to Arcadian enemies like Loyalists and their like sounds very appropriate, for the woks with the idea that Dubai's Freehold relays on letting Arcadia having a foothold in exchange for the protection given in the story. This Freehold seems to have a very twisted political structure, and I like it :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T06:00:00-08:00","id":832462,"title":"","content":"A question on the organisational side: Would there be a scheduled time or people just post when they can (but timely and regularly, obviously). With a scheduled time, me being in YUROP might cause issues.<br /> <br /> Apologies for not being very active in Court creation right now, kind of swamped with real life stuff, but that would be resolved by the 22nd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T08:27:03-08:00","id":832536,"title":"","content":"scheduled time may be a problem for me too, because my &quot;winter break&quot; would soon be over and then I'll return to the university :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T14:29:45-08:00","id":832760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>saibot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832462#post832462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A question on the organisational side: Would there be a scheduled time or people just post when they can (but timely and regularly, obviously). With a scheduled time, me being in YUROP might cause issues.<br /> <br /> Apologies for not being very active in Court creation right now, kind of swamped with real life stuff, but that would be resolved by the 22nd.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't worry I'm buried under work too. I'm going with post when you can. Scheduling times may get stuff done faster, but its way more inconvenient.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T14:49:14-08:00","id":832769,"title":"","content":"Guys, my sick days are ending near and I still cannot make character without Courts ( Kiths and Seemings are a bit too much for now to decide ). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Could we finalize this concept step first - so I could know what can I choose politiclly and build with rest of the character?<br /> <br /> <b>What is consensus on Courts of Dubai now?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T15:05:35-08:00","id":832781,"title":"","content":"yeah, it is a bit messy- conceptually, I'm leaning toward either Stars or Pearls, but still a more sold writeup would be welcomed.<br /> <br /> The rest of the character concept is, more or less, solid. While my instinct is toward making an expat, I think I'll get out of my comfort zone and make a former-muslim citizen (his Durance in the hands of his Keeper is a major factor for him losing his faith).<br /> <br /> Second Chances- could you please give some detail about how the people in Dubai (citizens and expats) are usually dressed and things like that? From the internet, it seems like the citizens prefer traditional dress over western, but I prefer to not trust the internet so I won't make a caricature instead of a character, and I am a visual thinker :P<br /> <br /> Other than that, I already have most of the character prepared to be written as a Snowskin Darkling, based Mental Skills/Attributes- I've thought about perhaps adapting the Snow Queen into a &quot;Sands Queen&quot; of some kind, but the idea of Snowskin in the desert as a (extremely sorry for the pun) Special Snowflake (I kinda hate myself right now) is way too tempting- and besides, I think it also fits the themes of the setting: Dubai is not only where people from all around the world gather to do business. It is where stories gather too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 02-18-2016, 06:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T15:08:28-08:00","id":832783,"title":"","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> I was wondering if you might have room for one more player? I finally got a chance to read the playtest documents, and have some ideas I would like to try out. If not, it's totally understandable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T15:26:21-08:00","id":832790,"title":"","content":"I actually have a character concept already (I think I'm conceptually working opposite from wyrdhamster, since I have no clue what Court he'll be in, but I got pretty much everything else figured out).<br /> <br /> I'm thinking Fairest Thusser (trying hard to avoid the Dual-Kith temptation). I want to create a character that's more immersed in the culture (rather than my original foreigner idea), but since I'm rather unfamiliar with it, I'm trying to stay on the thin line between realism and stereotyping. Right now I'm tentatively considering that his mother came from a progressive Muslim family, she went to college and got several degrees in different languages, and worked as a translator and interpreter for different businesses in Dubai. Eventually, she met a European businessman, they fell in love, married and had two sons. My guy's the youngest child. The older brother was everything their parents wanted, while my guy always failed to live up to their expectations, constantly repressing parts of himself for approval.<br /> <br /> Not sure if this fits the setting, hence why I'm throwing the character concept out there early, so that I can go back to the drawing board if it's a wash.<br /> <br /> EDIT: The last Kiths were revealed. Can't stay away from the Dual-Kith temptation. Thusser/Dearheart it is!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":10056,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","user":"ShadowKnight1224","date":". 02-19-2016, 12:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T20:49:05-08:00","id":832992,"title":"","content":"So with new Kiths ideas, I finally may found two concepts that could work with my previous bent on <i>Arabian Nights</i> aesthetics. But it also clash with idea that I will play expat in Dubai. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> That\u2019s why I have proposition to rest of players \u2013 <b>Maybe our characters have common history in Arcadia, even when taken away on Earth from other parts of globe?</b> Uncovering those connections with rising Wyrd can be nice subplot of chronicle.<br /> <br /> And that way I can have foreign Jinn-like character that have reason to go to Dubai and found the story and \u201cplace of his fae forefathers\u201d, even if he would be swooped by True Fae from the streets of Saint Petersburg or New York. Or maybe even Toronto, to have some background hook with spoiled setting \u2013 especially as I hear the Canadian contractors are all over Dubai. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> My hashed two character concepts I need to choose from. Your comments are more than welcome on those.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Arabian Gh\u016bl</i> </b>\u2013 Corpsegrinder Darkling \u2013 I like dark image this character would have. And always wanted to run flesh eater monster. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> But Kith\u2019s Blessing will have a low usage in low combat game, I suppose. Also, I have a hard time imagining him as proud LGBT character, fighting with social norms of Dubai.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Fire Jinn</i></b> \u2013 Flamesiren Elemental or Fairest \u2013 Much more classical and safe choice. Seductive and made of Smokeless Fire. With 2ED Seemings, Fairest could be interesting choice on the idea of LGBT movement metaphor leader. Not sure I like center of Kith\u2019s Blessing on performance, but I think it would be okay character.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m tempted to go with Gh\u016bl idea, but Kith\u2019s Blessing wording sounds that it would almost never come in to PbP play\u2026 <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-18-2016, 11:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T21:00:12-08:00","id":832996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832992#post832992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That\u2019s why I have proposition to rest of players \u2013 <b>Maybe our characters have common history in Arcadia, even when taken away on Earth from other parts of globe?</b> Uncovering those connections with rising Wyrd can be nice subplot of chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am a huge fan of doing this, so sign me up for any and all connections and backstory between characters. I've already finished a &quot;first draft&quot; of my character sheet, so I'm pretty much ready to link Khalid Al Ajam with the rest of the (motley) crew.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=832992#post832992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b><i>Arabian Gh\u016bl</i> </b>\u2013 Corpsegrinder Darkling \u2013 I like dark image this character would have. And always wanted to run flesh eater monster. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> But Kith\u2019s Blessing will have a low usage in low combat game, I suppose. Also, I have a hard time imagining him as proud LGBT character, fighting with social norms of Dubai.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Fire Jinn</i></b> \u2013 Flamesiren Elemental or Fairest \u2013 Much more classical and safe choice. Seductive and made of Smokeless Fire. With 2ED Seemings, Fairest could be interesting choice on the idea of LGBT movement metaphor leader. Not sure I like center of Kith\u2019s Blessing on performance, but I think it would be okay character.</div> </div> </div> </div>I might be biased, but my vote goes to the Flamesiren. While I agree that the ghul idea is interesting from a mythological standpoint, I feel that the Flamesiren might fit the themes and mood of the setting better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T21:47:19-08:00","id":833019,"title":"","content":"I imagine some of us will have a common arcadian experience. We just need to wait to see beginning concepts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T22:00:05-08:00","id":833031,"title":"","content":"If not going with Arabian Ghul idea, I will probably become demonic Incubus by <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/832889-moar-kiths?p=833014#post833014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...</div> </div> </div> </div> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <i>Take the Dual Kith Merit and mixed a Darkling Dearheart/Flamesiren for a demonic Succubus. He/She can see in darkness, has the sympathetic merit (what ever that is), can give someone the swoon condition, is fiery to that person's touch, gets \u2022\u2022 Striking looks, can get info about them with a touch, and can drop their compsure by half their wyrd with a touch.<br /> <br /> At medium to high levels of wyrd or with that new Kith merit, the Dearheart can destroy any meaningful resistance to a seduction. </i><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T03:26:58-08:00","id":833139,"title":"","content":"Thing to have in mind if we go with Shaytan as Court concept...<br /> <br /> ( From Merits Playtest )<br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Seasons Change</b> </span><br /> If a changeling wishes to join a new court instead of simply relying on its goodwill, shedding the Mantle of one court and adopting the Mantle of another, the rituals and requirements vary drastically between courts. She may have to make amends to one she\u2019s left or suffer a dangerous ban for weeks to follow. Joining the new court may require an offering of a Token or Goblin Fruit, or a quest that proves her worth to her new peers.<br /> <br /> Mechanically, this is represented by her dots in the existing Mantle being reduced by half (rounded down) and transforming them into dots of Court Goodwill for the court she left behind. Any dots in Court Goodwill that were associated her new court are halved (rounded down) as well, and those become dots in the adopted court\u2019s Mantle. A character with zero dots in Court Goodwill for the court she\u2019s trying to join is going to have a hell of time at the lowest ranks. She begins with a single dot of Mantle and a whole lot of skeptical looks.<br /> <br /> Merit dots lost in this way are subject to the Sanctity of Merits (see, p. XX). </i><br /> <br /> <br /> But it can lead to interesting twist based on rules - <b>Having collecting Goodwill with Shaytan Court can prepare</b><b> you for the coming of new Iblis and forsaking your previous Court for the high standing in Shaytan one.</b><br /> <br /> In other words, Lost in Dubai can literally help their &quot;Devil&quot; do his works to groom themselves for high standing in it's next regime. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I imagine Courtiers unsatisfied with their politics of classic Courts of Dubai secretly helps Shaytan Court, many hoping to cash Goodwill if things go too far in their original Court.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-19-2016, 06:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T05:03:17-08:00","id":833164,"title":"","content":"Have rough idea on my expat job in Dubai - some kind of lower &quot;middle-man&quot; to setting contractors crews with clients. Likes to &quot;have fun&quot; in night &quot;business meetings&quot; in Dubai clubs. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Here are Merits I will most certainly take:<br /> <br /> <b>Dual Kith</b> 3 (Dearheart/Flamesiren)<br /> <br /> <b>Market Sense</b> (1)<br /> <br /> <b>Multilingual</b> (3) \u2013 <b><i>Need few most often employed ethnics as contractors in Dubai. And having Arabic in here also. Any help in pointing those is most wanted.</i></b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Rigid Mask</b> (2)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-19-2016, 08:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T07:14:26-08:00","id":833229,"title":"","content":"My current merits are Dual-Kith, Striking Looks 2, Language (English), Interdisciplinary Specialty (Posing), and Enchanting Performance 3