e\u2026<br /> <br /> <i>As of 2013, only 10-15% of the population of the emirate was made up of ArabUAE nationals, with the rest comprising expatriates, many of whom either have been in the country for generations or were born in the UAE. Approximately 85% of the expatriate population (and 71% of the emirate's total population) was Asian, chiefly Indian (51%) and Pakistani (16%); other significant Asian groups include Bangladeshis (9%) and Filipinos (3%). There is a sizable community of Somalis numbering around 30,000, as well as other communities of various nationalities. A quarter of the population reportedly traces their origins to Iran. In addition, 16% of the population (or 288,000 persons) living in collective labour accommodation were not identified by ethnicity or nationality, but were thought to be primarily Asian. There are over 100,000 British expatriates in Dubai, by far the largest group of Western expatriates in the city. The median age in the emirate was about 27 years. In 2014, there were estimated to be 15.54 births and 1.99 deaths per 1,000 people.<br /> <br /> Arabic is the national and official language of the United Arab Emirates. The Gulf dialect of Arabic is spoken natively by the Emirati people. English is used as a second language. Other major languages spoken in Dubai due to immigration are <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hindi\" target=\"_blank\">Hindi</a>-<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Urdu\" target=\"_blank\">Urdu</a> (or <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hindustani_language\" target=\"_blank\">Hindustani</a>), <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persian_language\" target=\"_blank\">Persian</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malayalam\" target=\"_blank\">Malayalam</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punjabi_language\" target=\"_blank\">Punjabi</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pashto_language\" target=\"_blank\">Pashto</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bengali_language\" target=\"_blank\">Bengali</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sindhi_language\" target=\"_blank\">Sindhi</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Balochi_language\" target=\"_blank\">Balochi</a>,<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tulu_language\" target=\"_blank\">Tulu</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tamil_language\" target=\"_blank\">Tamil</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kannada\" target=\"_blank\">Kannada</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinhala_language\" target=\"_blank\">Sinhala</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marathi_language\" target=\"_blank\">Marathi</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telugu_language\" target=\"_blank\">Telugu</a>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tagalog_language\" target=\"_blank\">Tagalog</a> and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chinese_language\" target=\"_blank\">Chinese</a>, in addition to many other languages.</i><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-19T09:16:24-08:00","id":833330,"title":"","content":"Thanks! I also want to note my character knows only Arabic for the lack of Merit dots (the price you have to pay for character concept :P)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge