"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowKnight1224</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834183#post834183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the courts, I think they support a good variety of interesting concepts. I think I'll go for the Court of Spires with my character.</div> </div> </div> </div>You don't think Stars and Pearls are too close? They'll be more distinct once I get them written up, but part of me felt like those emotions are super close together. I like both though, so maybe that was just me being self critical.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T20:35:10-08:00","id":834227,"title":"","content":"I worry a little about Spires and sand being too close, but I wanna see where you're going with them first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T20:36:00-08:00","id":834228,"title":"","content":"<b>What about our hot topic - Shaytan Court or Motley then?</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834221#post834221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You don't think Stars and Pearls are too close? They'll be more distinct once I get them written up, but part of me felt like those emotions are super close together. I like both though, so maybe that was just me being self critical.</div> </div> </div> </div>They <i>does</i> seem a bit redundant, but maybe proper write up will make them distinctive?<br /> <br /> And <i>Mr. Tannous</i> sounds like Court of Stars material to me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also - Stars and Fire, I like combination of this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T20:45:49-08:00","id":834232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834228#post834228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>What about our hot topic - Shaytan Court or Motley then?</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> They <i>does</i> seem a bit redundant, but maybe proper write up will make them distinctive?<br /> <br /> And <i>Mr. Tannous</i> sounds like Court of Stars material to me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also - Stars and Fire, I like combination of this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Motley. An entire court of Shaytan doesn't fit with the themes or emotions that the real city of Dubai evokes, which I do want to bring across. Plus a court devoted to extolling any one group of people, especially Jinn, would be such a horrific blasphemy to their sensibilities. I can't and won't run with it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T20:51:03-08:00","id":834237,"title":"","content":"<b>Can changeling be part of multiple Motleys?</b> I did not get this when reading 1ED materials last year...<br /> <br /> I assume it would need to be this way, as at least some percentage of Freehold should secretly support Shaytans, don't they?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T21:07:16-08:00","id":834245,"title":"","content":"Yes, a changeling can be part of multiple motleys.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T21:13:24-08:00","id":834248,"title":"","content":"Looking over the Goblin Vows I think maybe good idea would be pointing 2-3 typical Wyrd aspects that could be made with Court Mantle 2nd dot in Court's write-ups - they should shine on the variety of Court in question and point the differences in Courtiers.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Goblin Vow (\u2022 to \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Your character has the ability to craft pledges with an aspect of the Wyrd itself, negotiating with it directly as though it was an individual. For each dot she has in this merit, she has a connection with one purview of the Wyrd. These purviews are specific subsets of larger aspects, similar to the way Skill Specializations are a narrower focus of a broader skill. \u201cTime\u201d is too broad of an aspect to have a<br /> connection with, as is \u201cevening\u201d, but \u201chigh noon\u201d, \u201crush hour\u201d, \u201cthe witching hour\u201d, and \u201cthe eleventh hour\u201d are all acceptably narrow aspects. Similarly, \u201clove\u201d is too general of a purview, but \u201cunrequited love\u201d, \u201cjealous love\u201d, \u201cbroken hearts\u201d, and \u201ctrue love\u201d are appropriate purviews. </i><br /> <br /> <b>For example, what could Court of Stars have in Goblin Vows?</b> &quot;Ambition&quot; I suppose, maybe &quot;Burning&quot;, possibly &quot;Grandiose&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 02-21-2016, 12:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T21:18:26-08:00","id":834249,"title":"","content":"Plasma of some sort-electricity, perhaps.<br /> <br /> Stars are just smokeless fire, after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T22:10:08-08:00","id":834266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834248#post834248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looking over the Goblin Vows I think maybe good idea would be pointing 2-3 typical Wyrd aspects that could be made with Court Mantle 2nd dot in Court's write-ups - they should shine on the variety of Court in question and point the differences in Courtiers.<br /> <br /> <i><b>Goblin Vow (\u2022 to \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)</b><br /> Your character has the ability to craft pledges with an aspect of the Wyrd itself, negotiating with it directly as though it was an individual. For each dot she has in this merit, she has a connection with one purview of the Wyrd. These purviews are specific subsets of larger aspects, similar to the way Skill Specializations are a narrower focus of a broader skill. \u201cTime\u201d is too broad of an aspect to have a<br /> connection with, as is \u201cevening\u201d, but \u201chigh noon\u201d, \u201crush hour\u201d, \u201cthe witching hour\u201d, and \u201cthe eleventh hour\u201d are all acceptably narrow aspects. Similarly, \u201clove\u201d is too general of a purview, but \u201cunrequited love\u201d, \u201cjealous love\u201d, \u201cbroken hearts\u201d, and \u201ctrue love\u201d are appropriate purviews. </i><br /> <br /> <b>For example, what could Court of Stars have in Goblin Vows?</b> &quot;Ambition&quot; I suppose, maybe &quot;Burning&quot;, possibly &quot;Grandiose&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ambition or Audacity fit with the vision I have of the Court of Stars. Where are you getting the stats for Goblin Vow from? I can't find them anywhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T22:13:30-08:00","id":834267,"title":"","content":"<b>ArcaneArts</b> spoilered <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/834084-2nd-edition-goblin-vows\">Goblin Vows</a> for us last night. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> He also marked there will be change in Courts Mantle mechanics and structure - they are described in linked topic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T22:27:53-08:00","id":834271,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834227#post834227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I worry a little about Spires and sand being too close, but I wanna see where you're going with them first.</div> </div> </div> </div>Missed this. Of all of them, I don't think those are two you have to worry about. I see where you get it from, but Spires is about people who have been wowed and are caught up in the fast living lifestyle, while Sand is for those who are trapped and depressed, often the exact people who can't live it up get ignored by society. Make sense?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T00:40:09-08:00","id":834310,"title":"","content":"Bringing some basic character thoughts up, that may be expanded on later. I'll also do some sheet work.<br /> <br /> Daniel Hill was born to a mother from England and a father from Dubai itself. While he ended up with an English name, the family moved to the UAE when he was jut two years old and he's known that city for most of his life. (At last until his abduction). His parents were both rich and respected in the business world they inhabited and were involved in the lucrative oil trade, albeit it at the lower levels. Unfortunately, this led to Daniel becoming somewhat spoiled and arrogant as he grew up, a trait neither of his parents were ale to drum out of him. It didn't help that he was also creative and intelligent, and soon found himself with a number of promising apprenticeships for his future career.<br /> <br /> He signed the wrong contract.<br /> <br /> The Gentry who took him delighted in what It considered beauty and had acted the part of an architect in the human world. It instilled the heat of the desert in Daniel and used him s a pet, one trained to fly through the endless glass and steel it called art, flames flickering over the surfaces. Despite the pride it took in its creation, the Fae lacked the creative spark humanity possessed and rather then beautiful, its construction was a hideous mess.One day, one of its visitors told it that.<br /> <br /> Daniel managed to escape from the shattering glass and falling iron as his Master vented in fury, fleeing into the wilds at the edge of his Durance. Battered, weak and wounded, he barely made it through the Hedge alive as he clawed his way back to the world. That was some time ago now and he emerge to find his old life gone up like smoke. There was another where he used to be.<br /> <br /> Daniel now works as an archaeologist, his original dream of being an architect ruined by his Keeper. He takes a deep seated pleasure in study and learning, and also yearns to unravel all the mysteries he can, be they natural or supernatural in origin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T01:33:41-08:00","id":834326,"title":"","content":"I actually don't feel that Pearls and Stars are too close to each other- but emotions are a confusing thing, so a more distinct writeup won't harm anyone :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T05:10:34-08:00","id":834374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834221#post834221\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You don't think Stars and Pearls are too close? They'll be more distinct once I get them written up, but part of me felt like those emotions are super close together. I like both though, so maybe that was just me being self critical.</div> </div> </div> </div>Stars is about an external goal. You have an ambition to be or do something of importance, you want tangible success. Pearls is about internal goals. You want to confront your fears, grow stronger, feel brave.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T06:47:18-08:00","id":834397,"title":"","content":"I stated <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/834354-%E2%80%8Bfae-around-the-world\">discussion on Changeling core terms around the world</a> - our Dubai Freehold need Arabic touch in there so maybe propose in topic variants you got in researches? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T12:26:36-08:00","id":834564,"title":"","content":"A character idea: The child of migrant workers (from Malaysia I'm thinking), felt out of place in Dubai before the Durance, now feels out of place among humanity in general. Trying to find something to attach to. A Waterborn Elemental, I'm thinking; spends a good deal of time in or around the Persian Gulf, swimming around, doing work as a dive guide or the like, also on the lookout for underwater gateways into the Hedge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T12:45:21-08:00","id":834580,"title":"","content":"Since we otherwise would have a huge group and I am still busy, I think I am going to bow out of this for now. Sorry about that. Although if there might still be room down the line, I might join later. I will contact Second Chances via PM, if so.<br /> <br /> But for now, do enjoy yourself, ladies and gents!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T13:25:51-08:00","id":834603,"title":"","content":"Does anybody have any ideas for character ties? I was thinking since me and wyrdhamster are playing Dearhearts, we might've had similar Durances in the same realm, perhaps even under the same Keeper. espritdecalmar's Waterborn and LostLight's Snowskin may have crossed each other on their escape through the Hedge, perhaps?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T13:37:22-08:00","id":834609,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowKnight1224</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834603#post834603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anybody have any ideas for character ties? I was thinking since me and wyrdhamster are playing Dearhearts, we might've had similar Durances in the same realm, perhaps even under the same Keeper.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do not see a problem with that - I firstly assumed that even when <i>Mr. Tannous</i> was kidnapped in Toronto, he spend his Durance under &quot;arabic&quot; Keeper, related more with Dubai Freehold. I only mark that that this Incubus was a lover and servant of the Keeper, trusted with running &quot;palace&quot; stuff. Do you need to discus any details on Keeper in advance? Any informations I would need to know?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T13:45:26-08:00","id":834612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834609#post834609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do not see a problem with that - I firstly assumed that even when <i>Mr. Tannous</i> was kidnapped in Toronto, he spend his Durance under &quot;arabic&quot; Keeper, related more with Dubai Freehold. I only mark that that this Incubus was a lover and servant of the Keeper, trusted with running &quot;palace&quot; stuff. Do you need to discus any details on Keeper in advance? Any informations I would need to know?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was actually hoping to build a Durance/Arcadian Realm with my fellow players, so feel free to throw in some ideas. I had thought for Khalid that he had been taken to keep up morale among other changelings, singing and offering them respite, and he had often helped other changelings escape but never had the courage to do it himself (hence the Fairest Seeming once he eventually escapes).<br /> <br /> If we're going with the Arabian theme, why not a palace of sandstone and topaz in the middle of an everlasting sandstorm? The Keeper could be &quot;The Malik of Burning Winds&quot; and enjoy going out in a &quot;Wild Hunt&quot; fairly often to bring back &quot;prices&quot; from the mortal world. These changelings would be made to keep his palace clean, serve him, cook for him, tend to his every need, and so on. Does that sound like an acceptable Keeper for Mr. Tannous?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":10056,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","user":"ShadowKnight1224","date":". 02-21-2016, 04:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T14:09:19-08:00","id":834619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowKnight1224</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834612#post834612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was actually hoping to build a Durance/Arcadian Realm with my fellow players, so feel free to throw in some ideas. I had thought for Khalid that he had been taken to keep up morale among other changelings, singing and offering them respite, and he had often helped other changelings escape but never had the courage to do it himself (hence the Fairest Seeming once he eventually escapes).</div> </div> </div> </div>So the Khalid was &quot;Pashas&quot; ( Keeper ) Jester? Because it sounds as it is...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowKnight1224</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834612#post834612\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If we're going with the Arabian theme, why not a palace of sandstone and topaz in the middle of an everlasting sandstorm? The Keeper could be &quot;The Malik of Burning Winds&quot; and enjoy going out in a &quot;Wild Hunt&quot; fairly often to bring back &quot;prices&quot; from the mortal world. These changelings would be made to keep his palace clean, serve him, cook for him, tend to his every need, and so on. Does that sound like an acceptable Keeper for Mr. Tannous?</div> </div> </div> </div>As to palace itself - I do not see a problem in that. Mr. Tannous could be like some a bit impulsive first lover running Malik's fantastic <i>harem</i>. He was both scared and fascinated of the Keeper, that's why he &quot;embraced the fires&quot; of him, quite literally. Mr. Tannous probably would <i>not</i> be serving or even make direct demands - but he would be hospital and careing on the rest of <i>harem </i>and any mortal or changeling in it - treating them all as his own new family, trying to convince them that they are not slaves, only guests and lovers of careing Malik. At least to time when &quot;new face&quot; would not be too good for the Malik itself... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Think of Tannous Durance as the &quot;first wife&quot; (husband?) in the harems of Ottaman Empire. Or just watch some <b>Magnificent Century</b> series. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( My parents watch this in Polish TV and even I'm middly interested in it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YiffTi-qKCk\" data-code=\"YiffTi-qKCk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/YiffTi-qKCk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <b>As to &quot;Wild Hunts&quot; of Keeper - is not Huntsmen jobs in 2ED?</b> I can see the Keeper is leading Hunt from time to time, but from the spoilers I got image that it's Huntsmen that are &quot;day-to-day&quot; mortals-to-changelings procurers.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T14:13:11-08:00","id":834621,"title":"","content":"tying all characters together in their Arcadian Durance does not feel necessary to me- there are enough opportunities for my character to interact with local chengelings after his Escape. The best way to draw his attention without a second thought? have something he wants. O by a way to get something he wants. Or be in the way. Or anything- changelings are a closed community, after all. Someone had to help him creating a false identity, or get access for information or something. We don't need to force everything into &quot;they are all best friends/sworn enemies since their Durance&quot;- if you have an organic way to do so and you want to, great! But such as easily it could be &quot;hey- don't I know you from somewhere? Oh, yeah! You were the one who hired my for doing that Dreamweaved sex-doll! How did that worked for you?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T14:22:14-08:00","id":834626,"title":"","content":"<b>There is also a middle ground - our changelings are from Keepers from the same Feud</b><b>.</b> Their Gentry were enemies, not the characters - and the could meet once or twice in Durance, on some conflict related scenes.<br /> <br /> I just want to stressed it - <b>I do not want any one forced in to those relations.</b> Just have idea for character concept that could easy this kind mechanics if one want it with my PC. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T14:22:57-08:00","id":834627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834619#post834619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the Khalid was &quot;Pashas&quot; ( Keeper ) Jester? Because it sounds as it is...</div> </div> </div> </div>More like the guy in the servant's quarters that sings old songs from their homeland during their meals, and whose job is to always be available to other changelings for stress relief. Part bard, part whore, part that one person you go to complain when things go wrong in your life. He was probably expected to be a &quot;spy&quot; for the changelings that were loyal to Malik (like Mr. Tannous) to identify problematic changelings. So Khalid probably walked a fine line between helping changelings escape and maintaining his cover.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking somewhere in his mind, Khalid's conflicted between feeling like he wasn't good enough for Malik's harem, and chastising himself for feeling that way.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834619#post834619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As to palace itself - I do not see a problem in that. Mr. Tannous could be like some a bit impulsive first lover running Malik's fantastic <i>harem</i>. He was both scared and fascinated of the Keeper, that's why he &quot;embraced the fires&quot; of him, quite literally. Mr. Tannous probably would <i>not</i> be serving or even make direct demands - but he would be hospital and careing on the rest of <i>harem </i>and any mortal or changeling in it - treating them all as his own new family, trying to convince them that they are not slaves, only guests and lovers of careing Malik. At least to time when &quot;new face&quot; would not be too good for the Malik itself... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds good! I like the idea that the palace was a place of excessive luxury and indulgence.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834619#post834619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Think of Tannous Durance as the &quot;first wife&quot; (husband?) in the harems of Ottaman Empire. Or just watch some <b>Magnificent Century</b> series. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( My parents watch this in Polish TV and even I'm middly interested in it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YiffTi-qKCk\" data-code=\"YiffTi-qKCk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/YiffTi-qKCk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Very interesting visual reference. I think that fits the general theme of the Durance fairly well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834619#post834619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>As to &quot;Wild Hunts&quot; of Keeper - is not Huntsmen jobs in 2ED?</b> I can see the Keeper is leading Hunt from time to time, but from the spoilers I got image that it's Huntsmen that are &quot;day-to-day&quot; mortals-to-changelings procurers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huntsmen are sent to retrieve specific things. They have an &quot;icon&quot; of whatever they're sent after (usually a changeling). If anybody accompanies a Gentry on a Wild Hunt for new changelings, it's probably a Loyalist or Privateer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T14:28:47-08:00","id":834629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834626#post834626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>There is also a middle ground - our changelings are from Keepers from the same Feud</b><b>.</b> Their Gentry were enemies, not the characters - and the could meet once or twice in Durance, on some conflict related scenes.<br /> <br /> I just want to stressed it - <b>I do not want any one forced in to those relations.</b> Just have idea for character concept that could easy this kind mechanics if one want it with my PC. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I was just throwing ideas that might feel organic for a connection. Yeah, forming a motley is going to be doable with some finagling, but I find it goes smoother if the changelings know each other beforehand.<br /> <br /> A Feud between a Malik of the Burning Winds and a snow queen and something water-related is fairly believable, as well, if we want to go down that route.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T14:31:09-08:00","id":834630,"title":"","content":"For the record - &quot;Mr. Tannous&quot; is newly forged Alternate Identity of my character. I will need to dwell a deeper to the prepare his proper background in the Durance and new Darkling Seeming. But I suspect some envy over Keepers new lover will be main switch... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-21T20:07:30-08:00","id":834799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>saibot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/831923-changeling-playtest-game?p=834580#post834580\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since we otherwise would have a huge group and I am still busy, I think I am going to bow out of this for now. Sorry about that. Although if there might still be room down the line, I might join later. I will contact Second Chances via PM, if so.<br /> <br /> But for now, do enjoy yourself, ladies and gents!</div> </div> </div> </div>No worries Sai! Stay in touch if you want. I totally get how if feels. <br /> <br /> I haven't read anything today (busy weekend!) but could I get everyone who is interested to PM me, just so I have a rough idea of who's game and who's not? It doesn't have to be long, just I'm in will do. It would help with organizing. Might get something else posted tonight, got some ideas for goblin vows in each Court.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=