cond-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T20:06:57-08:00","id":836825,"title":"","content":"So I slowly make <a href=\"http://www.myth-weavers.com/sheet.html#id=725084\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i>Mr. Tannous</i></b> char sheet</a> - only I'm a large stuck on Contrats section and will need few days to end it. I need to rehash all possible powers and try to cherry pick what will jive on start with character - I just cannot buy them all from the boot. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> As I have two long overdue <b>Mage</b> sessions in this week, I suspect till weekend I will not end, but in half of next week it should be ended.<br /> <br /> Other information beside Myth Wavers char sheets are needed? <b>Our characters needs Touchstones? </b>Because from what I seen in Playtests files, Touchstones in <b>CtL</b> 2ED are special Merits, in contrast to those in <b>Vampire</b> and <b>Werewolf </b>- which is pitty, as I literally cannot afford one for the character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T20:42:56-08:00","id":836832,"title":"","content":"I think you're missing skill specialties, Aspirations and Clarity Triggers, wyrd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/